  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.43 with immutable ProGPU preview.53 and adds portable logical primary-screen, work-area, and virtual-screen metrics for SystemParameters; retains per-monitor DPI propagation, multi-window popup routing, the portable WPF window-icon contract, WebGPU adapter-selection diagnostics, exact transformed and shader-backed stroke replay, native activation, bounded render-resource ownership, static-frame render suppression, Windows OLE clipboard, and the cross-platform WPFGallery and designer gates.",
